  "id": "grilled-pork-chops-with-honey-garlic-sauce",
  "name": "Grilled Pork Chops with Honey-Garlic Sauce",
  "subtitle": "Sweet-savory grilled pork for an easy dinner",
  "description": "Thick pork chops are grilled and finished with a quick honey, garlic, ketchup, and soy sauce mixture.",
